  "instructions": [
    "Peel and dice the celeriac into 1-inch cubes.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add the diced onion and cook until softened, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the celeriac and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally, until slightly tender.",
    "Add the pickle juice, smoked paprika, cumin, salt, and black pepper. Cook for an additional 2 minutes, until the celeriac is tender.",
    "Crumble the feta cheese and stir to combine with the celeriac mixture.",
    "Serve the celeriac hash hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley if desired."
